flowchart TD
    USER[User] --> UI[Local UI / CLI]
    UI -->|commands| CMD[Host Command API]
    CMD --> TE[Task Engine / Dynamic DAG]
    TE <-->|plan, escalation| ROOT[Root Supervisor / Pi Agent]
    TE -->|ready work| ORCH[Multi-Agent Orchestrator]
    ROOT -->|propose delegation| ORCH
    ORCH --> AT[Agent Tree / Team Manager]
    ORCH --> CC[Convergence Controller]
    ORCH --> CB[Context Builder]
    ORCH --> MS[Model Resource Scheduler]
    CB --> MEM[Memory Core port]
    CB --> ART[ArtifactStore]
    CB --> TE
    MS --> REG[Model Registry / Quota + Budget]
    ORCH --> EX[Agent Execution / Pi SDK Adapter]
    CB --> EX
    MS --> EX
    EX --> TOOL[Tool Gateway / Capability Gate]
    TOOL --> WS[Workspace + Sandbox Port]
    EX --> VE[Verification]
    VE -->|verified outcome| TE
    J[Judgment Kernel / rule + Jev shadow] -.-> ORCH
    J -.-> CB
    J -.-> MS
    EX --> EB[(Durable event / outbox)]
    TE --> EB
    ORCH --> EB
    MEM --> EB
    MS --> EB
    EB --> UI
    EB --> OBS[Observability / Evaluation]
    OBS -.->|versioned performance profile, optional| REG
